  "name": "Butternut Squash and Cherry Tomato Crumble",
  "subtitle": "Creamy squash, tomato, and spinach beneath a crisp walnut-cheese topping",
  "description": "A savory baked vegetable crumble combining tender butternut squash, cherry tomatoes, mascarpone, and spinach with a buttery, nutty topping.",
